e facial outline beneath a local veil of glow. Cool shadows surround the opposite cheek while the backlit crown and dress edges carry pale halos and localized overexposure. The shallow depth of field turns the distant vegetation and far bank into soft green washes and scattered points of light. Watercolor blooms spread through the background, while crisp hand-drawn lines remain concentrated on the woman, her ornate clothing, and the nearest dandelion seeds. Fuji LOMO color response gives the image faded cyan shadows, warm amber highlights, darkened corners, restrained contrast falloff, and high-grain analog texture. Fine canvas weave, oil-brush ridges, frosted noise, and translucent pigment layering cover the finished surface without hard digital sharpening."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 17, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [363.2131042480469, 262.9823913574219], "pos": [270, 1288.896728515625], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [12], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot.safetensors", "flux3", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [389.15777587890625, 106], "pos": [0, 767.44970703125], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "gener